t\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-571b6d8b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"571b6d8b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">NewGen\u2019s project team is made up of supervisors, operators and labourers that are fully qualified and competent to complete a multiple range of projects and scope with safety and quality being priority one.\u00a0 With the changes in the economy and industry over the last few years, there has been a shortage of experienced and skilled labour. Working closely with our partners and communities we are part of, we will be able to stay ahead of industry demand.\u00a0 NewGen will use its experience and expertise to help grow and train new employees as the industry requires. We have been fortunate to have hired some of the best staff in the area that have a wealth of knowledge and experience. Below is a table of our key personnel that are a big part of NewGen\u2019s success and future. \u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-45ba5193 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"45ba5193\" data-element_type=\"section\" id=\"environmental\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2db34bc6\" data-id=\"2db34bc6\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-54ca7269 profileText elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"54ca7269\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Blake Quinney<\/span><\/h3><h6><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">President, General Manager<\/span><\/h6><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Blake&#8217;s engineering background, local knowledge and vast experience in the oil and gas industry gives NewGen an advantage over other local contractors in the area. He is known for his hard work and honesty, with his leadership, NewGen can become one of the most versatile and reliable contractors in Alberta and B.C.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-60dbb821 profileText elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"60dbb821\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ryan Lefebvre<\/span><\/h3><h6><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Director, Business Development<\/span><\/h6><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ryan has over 15 years of experience in the Oil and Gas industry including seismic and civil earthworks projects.\u00a0 He works closely with Blake on the business development and provides support as required.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-59f5fef9 profileText elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"59f5fef9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Marvin Lefebvre<\/span><\/h3><h6><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Director, Corporate Finance<\/span><\/h6><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Marvin brings over 40 years of experience in the oil gas and industry including owning and operating a successful business for over 20 years.\u00a0 Marvin provides NewGen Projects financial stability and allows the company to grow and develop as required based on client needs and demand.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-154564cd\" data-id=\"154564cd\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-31d482fd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"31d482fd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We are a diverse group of individuals that includes successful business development and over 40 years of oil and gas experience with vast amounts of local and provincial experience.\u00a0 Our relationships are built on trust, we act with integrity, keep our word, and respect the situations around us. Our strength is in the power of our collaboration and teamwork. We believe in providing quality and value to our clients and the communities we strive to become part of.\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our goal is for NewGen to become entrenched in our local communities by providing employment opportunities and supporting local organizations throughout the area.\u00a0 Building on these relationships will allow NewGen to provide safe, quality and cost-efficient service for our clients.\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We believe our success will come from building honest and trustworthy working relationship that allows all parties involved to meet the goals that are set out.\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">NewGen Projects has certified COR Safety and we are a member of ISN and Complyworks.\u00a0 We hold $5,000,000 of general liability Insurance which can be increased or modified as required.\u00a0 All documentation can be provided upon request.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-5db18729 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"5db18729\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6d274e03\" data-id=\"6d274e03\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-15b494f4 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"15b494f4\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-63945021\" data-id=\"63945021\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-74e20b4 elementor-wi